  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "This module manages the serialization and GPU buffer management for light data used in rendering. It defines the memory layout (`LIGHTS_LAYOUT`) conforming to std140 for passing various light types (directional, point, spot) to WebGL shaders. The `LightsUBO` class handles the creation, updating, and binding of the WebGLUniformBufferObject, while `packLights` performs the complex data packing logic."
  },
